      "description": "<p>The skeleton removes its skull and throws it, making a jaws Strike with a range of 20 feet. It then attempts to Demoralize: Intimidation each foe within 10 feet of the target. The head bounces, rolls, or even flies back, returning to the skeleton at the start of its next turn. The skeleton is Blinded until then.</p>",
